# Lint before done

After editing any code, run lint before saying the task is complete:

```bash
npm run lint
```

If lint fails, fix the issues. Prefer auto-fix when available:

```bash
node tools/lint/jsImportStyle.js --fix
python3 tools/lint/pythonImportStyle.py --fix
```

Then re-run `npm run lint` until it passes.

Do not report work as finished while lint is failing.

Only skip lint for question-only or read-only tasks with no file edits.
